{
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In Tokyo,",
   "start": 0.07,
   "end": 0.8
  },
  {
   "text": "you can hire a man to do absolutely nothing.",
   "start": 1.02,
   "end": 3.69
  },
  {
   "text": "And thousands of people have.",
   "start": 4.14,
   "end": 5.64
  },
  {
   "text": "In twenty-eighteen, Shoji Morimoto was fired.",
   "start": 6.24,
   "end": 9.07
  },
  {
   "text": "His boss said he didn't do anything useful.",
   "start": 9.6,
   "end": 11.69
  },
  {
   "text": "So he made that his job.",
   "start": 12.26,
   "end": 13.96
  },
  {
   "text": "He waits at a marathon finish line.",
   "start": 14.49,
   "end": 16.29
  },
  {
   "text": "He rides the same train loop for seventeen hours.",
   "start": 16.77,
   "end": 19.7
  },
  {
   "text": "He waves goodbye at the station.",
   "start": 20.23,
   "end": 21.49
  },
  {
   "text": "He sits in a cafe while a woman hands in her divorce papers.",
   "start": 22.08,
   "end": 25.05
  },
  {
   "text": "He barely talks.",
   "start": 25.62,
   "end": 26.65
  },
  {
   "text": "He just stays.",
   "start": 27.17,
   "end": 28.26
  },
  {
   "text": "He says people need the presence of one human being.",
   "start": 28.9,
   "end": 31.64
  },
  {
   "text": "That's why we made Feeloy.",
   "start": 32.19,
   "end": 33.33
  },
  {
   "text": "Jenny is always there,",
   "start": 33.83,
   "end": 35.23
  },
  {
   "text": "day or night,",
   "start": 35.47,
   "end": 36.12
  },
  {
   "text": "even when you just need company.",
   "start": 36.46,
   "end": 37.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Search Feeloy on the App Store.",
   "start": 38.47,
   "end": 39.97
  }
 ]
}